scope: |
  SSC3-12 slice A. `Lower.flattenCurried` decides whether `f(a)(b)` is ONE call or a call whose
  result is applied, and it asks `sigs.exists(n.endsWith("." + nm) && ps.length == …)` — the
  receiver is not consulted, so a same-named method on ANY class can make that decision for a
  method it has nothing to do with. Last of three: the object case and the class case are fixed
  (e51b86956, 8dda5011c) and this one was named in both as the remainder.

  NARROW BY CONSTRUCTION: one function in one file. No gate, no board, no std. `v3/tests/front/`
  gains a fixture, which is additive.
